      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently commend Dr. Ghobrial and the clinical assistants for dependable medical care, compassionate attention, and responsiveness during routine visits and urgent health concerns. While most clients report reassuring and capable doctor interactions, a few reviewers mention occasional bedside friction and brief consultations."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 17,
      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate bedside attention for family pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers highlight gentle, considerate care for dogs and cats during routine wellness examinations, vaccinations, and minor medical treatments. Pet parents appreciate that staff help animals feel secure in the examination room, though isolated feedback noted discomfort while managing anxious pets during ear treatments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Contrasting views on treatment and testing"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Client feedback regarding clinic pricing is sharply divided. Some pet parents describe routine visit fees as reasonable and fair for Queens. Conversely, other reviewers express shock over steep diagnostic quotes, unexpected charges for routine ear cleaning procedures, and high estimates for sedated feline examinations."
      }
    }
